  id: graze
  displayName: Graze
  description: Peaceful herd animal. Roams the Lowlands. The basic source of meat
    and hide.
  behaviors:
  - Travels in herds of 4-8.
  - Flees if attacked or approached aggressively.
  - Can be tamed with Calming Pheromone or fed grain.
  - Plodder Cannon mount when fully bonded.
  habitat: Lowlands Fauna
  dropItemIds:
  - Raw Meat x2-3
  - Hide x1-2
  - Bone x1
  isTameable: 1
  isPassive: 1
  isAggressive: 1
  baseHealth: 50
  baseSpeed: 3
